@startuml 使用案例6_1: 通知瀏覽
title 使用案例6.1: 通知瀏覽流程

actor "所有使用者" as User
participant "NotificationBell.vue" as Bell
participant "NotificationCenter.vue" as Center
participant "useNotifications.ts" as Composable
participant "client.ts" as API
participant "notifications.py\n(blueprint)" as Blueprint
participant "notification_service.py" as Service
participant "others.py(Notification)(model)" as NotificationModel
participant "user.py(model)" as UserModel
database "MySQL" as DB

== Stage 1: 頁面初始化與輪詢啟動 ==
User -> Bell: 頁面載入\n(Navbar 中的通知圖示)
activate Bell
Bell -> Composable: startPolling()\n啟動通知輪詢
activate Composable
Composable -> Composable: 設定輪詢間隔 (30秒)

== Stage 2: 取得未讀通知數量 ==
Composable -> API: fetchUnreadCount()
activate API
API -> Blueprint: GET /notifications/unread-count
activate Blueprint
Blueprint -> Blueprint: @jwt_required() 驗證 JWT token
Blueprint -> Blueprint: 從 token 取得 current_user_id

Blueprint -> Service: get_unread_count(user_id)
activate Service
Service -> NotificationModel: 查詢未讀數量
activate NotificationModel
NotificationModel -> DB: SELECT COUNT(*)\nFROM notifications\nWHERE recipient_id=?\nAND read=False
activate DB
DB --> NotificationModel: count
deactivate DB
NotificationModel --> Service: count
deactivate NotificationModel
Service --> Blueprint: unread_count
deactivate Service

Blueprint --> API: 200 OK {unread_count: N}
deactivate Blueprint
API --> Composable: unread_count
deactivate API
Composable -> Composable: unreadCount.value = N
Composable --> Bell: 更新未讀徽章顯示
deactivate Composable
Bell -> Bell: 顯示未讀數量徽章\n(若 > 99 則顯示 "99+")
Bell --> User: 顯示未讀數量 (紅色徽章)
deactivate Bell

note over Bell, Composable
輪詢機制每 30 秒自動執行一次
fetchUnreadCount() 更新未讀數量
end note

== Stage 3: 點擊通知鈴鐺開啟下拉選單 ==
User -> Bell: 點擊通知鈴鐺圖示
activate Bell
Bell -> Bell: toggleDropdown()\nshowDropdown = true

== Stage 4: 載入最新通知列表 ==
Bell -> Composable: fetchNotifications()
activate Composable
Composable -> API: GET /notifications
activate API
API -> Blueprint: GET /notifications
activate Blueprint
Blueprint -> Blueprint: @jwt_required() 驗證
Blueprint -> Blueprint: 取得 current_user_id

== Stage 5: 查詢通知資料 ==
Blueprint -> Service: list_notifications(user_id, read_filter=None, page=1, per_page=20)
activate Service
Service -> NotificationModel: 查詢通知列表
activate NotificationModel
NotificationModel -> DB: SELECT * FROM notifications\nWHERE recipient_id=?\nORDER BY created_at DESC\nLIMIT 20 OFFSET 0
activate DB
DB --> NotificationModel: notifications records
deactivate DB
NotificationModel --> Service: notifications[]\n(含 type, payload, read, created_at)
deactivate NotificationModel

Service -> Service: 組裝回應資料\n- 計算總頁數\n- 格式化日期\n- 包含分頁資訊
Service --> Blueprint: {notifications[], total, page, per_page, pages}
deactivate Service

== Stage 6: 回傳通知列表 ==
Blueprint --> API: 200 OK {notifications[], total}
deactivate Blueprint
API --> Composable: notifications[]
deactivate API
Composable -> Composable: notifications.value = notifications[]
Composable --> Bell: notifications
deactivate Composable

== Stage 7: 渲染通知下拉選單 ==
Bell -> Bell: 渲染通知列表\n- 未讀通知藍色背景\n- 顯示通知訊息\n- 顯示相對時間 (formatDistanceToNow)\n- 最多顯示 5 則
Bell --> User: 顯示通知下拉選單
deactivate Bell

note over Bell
通知類型顯示邏輯 (getNotificationMessage):
- application_submitted: "您的申請已提交：{動物名}"
- application_approved: "您的申請已通過：{動物名}"
- application_rejected: "您的申請已被拒絕：{動物名}"
- animal_published: "您的動物已發布：{動物名}"
- animal_retired: "動物已下架：{動物名}"
- system_notification: 自訂訊息
end note

== Stage 8: 使用者操作選擇 ==
note over User, Bell
使用者可以執行以下操作:
1. 點擊通知項目 (標記為已讀)
2. 點擊「全部標為已讀」
3. 刪除個別通知
4. 點擊「查看全部」進入通知中心
5. 點擊外部區域關閉下拉選單
end note

alt 操作 1: 點擊通知項目

== Stage 9a: 標記單一通知為已讀 ==
User -> Bell: 點擊通知項目
activate Bell
Bell -> Bell: handleNotificationClick(notification)\n檢查 notification.read

alt 通知未讀
    Bell -> Composable: markAsRead(notification_id)
    activate Composable
    Composable -> API: POST /notifications/{id}/mark-read
    activate API
    API -> Blueprint: POST /notifications/{notification_id}/mark-read
    activate Blueprint
    Blueprint -> Blueprint: @jwt_required() 驗證
    Blueprint -> Blueprint: 取得 current_user_id

    == Stage 10a: 更新通知狀態 ==
    Blueprint -> Service: mark_as_read(notification_id, user_id)
    activate Service
    Service -> NotificationModel: 查詢通知
    activate NotificationModel
    NotificationModel -> DB: SELECT * FROM notifications\nWHERE notification_id=?\nAND recipient_id=?
    activate DB
    DB --> NotificationModel: notification record
    deactivate DB
    NotificationModel --> Service: notification
    deactivate NotificationModel

    Service -> Service: 驗證權限\nIF notification不存在:\nraise ValueError('通知不存在')

    Service -> NotificationModel: 更新通知狀態
    activate NotificationModel
    NotificationModel -> DB: UPDATE notifications\nSET read=True, read_at=NOW()\nWHERE notification_id=?
    activate DB
    DB --> NotificationModel: success
    deactivate DB
    NotificationModel --> Service: success
    deactivate NotificationModel

    Service -> Service: db.session.commit()
    Service --> Blueprint: notification (read=True)
    deactivate Service
    Blueprint --> API: 200 OK {notification}
    deactivate Blueprint
    API --> Composable: notification
    deactivate API

    Composable -> Composable: 更新本地狀態\n- notifications[index] = updated\n- unreadCount -= 1
    Composable --> Bell: success
    deactivate Composable
end

Bell -> Bell: closeDropdown()\nshowDropdown = false
Bell --> User: 關閉下拉選單並導航 (TODO)
deactivate Bell

else 操作 2: 全部標為已讀

== Stage 9b: 標記所有通知為已讀 ==
User -> Bell: 點擊「全部標為已讀」
activate Bell
Bell -> Composable: markAllAsRead()
activate Composable
Composable -> API: POST /notifications/mark-all-read
activate API
API -> Blueprint: POST /notifications/mark-all-read
activate Blueprint
Blueprint -> Blueprint: @jwt_required() 驗證
Blueprint -> Blueprint: 取得 current_user_id

== Stage 10b: 批次更新通知狀態 ==
Blueprint -> Service: mark_all_as_read(user_id)
activate Service
Service -> NotificationModel: 批次更新通知
activate NotificationModel
NotificationModel -> DB: UPDATE notifications\nSET read=True, read_at=NOW()\nWHERE recipient_id=?\nAND read=False
activate DB
DB --> NotificationModel: updated_count
deactivate DB
NotificationModel --> Service: updated_count
deactivate NotificationModel

Service -> Service: db.session.commit()
Service --> Blueprint: updated_count
deactivate Service
Blueprint --> API: 200 OK {message, updated_count}
deactivate Blueprint
API --> Composable: {updated_count}
deactivate API

Composable -> Composable: 更新本地狀態\n- 所有 notifications.read = true\n- unreadCount = 0
Composable --> Bell: success
deactivate Composable
Bell -> Bell: 重新渲染列表\n所有通知顯示為已讀
Bell --> User: 顯示成功訊息
deactivate Bell

else 操作 3: 刪除通知

== Stage 9c: 刪除個別通知 ==
User -> Bell: 點擊通知的刪除按鈕 (×)
activate Bell
Bell -> Composable: deleteNotification(notification_id)
activate Composable
Composable -> API: DELETE /notifications/{id}
activate API
API -> Blueprint: DELETE /notifications/{notification_id}
activate Blueprint
Blueprint -> Blueprint: @jwt_required() 驗證
Blueprint -> Blueprint: 取得 current_user_id

== Stage 10c: 刪除通知 ==
Blueprint -> Service: delete_notification(notification_id, user_id)
activate Service
Service -> NotificationModel: 查詢通知
activate NotificationModel
NotificationModel -> DB: SELECT * FROM notifications\nWHERE notification_id=?\nAND recipient_id=?
activate DB
DB --> NotificationModel: notification record
deactivate DB
NotificationModel --> Service: notification
deactivate NotificationModel

Service -> Service: 驗證權限\nIF notification不存在:\nraise ValueError('通知不存在')

Service -> NotificationModel: 刪除通知
activate NotificationModel
NotificationModel -> DB: DELETE FROM notifications\nWHERE notification_id=?
activate DB
DB --> NotificationModel: success
deactivate DB
NotificationModel --> Service: success
deactivate NotificationModel

Service -> Service: db.session.commit()
Service --> Blueprint: success
deactivate Service
Blueprint --> API: 200 OK {message: '通知已刪除'}
deactivate Blueprint
API --> Composable: success
deactivate API

Composable -> Composable: 從本地列表移除\n- notifications.splice(index, 1)\n- 若未讀則 unreadCount -= 1
Composable --> Bell: success
deactivate Composable
Bell -> Bell: 重新渲染列表\n移除該通知項目
Bell --> User: 通知消失
deactivate Bell

else 操作 4: 進入通知中心

== Stage 9d: 導航至通知中心頁面 ==
User -> Bell: 點擊「查看全部」連結
activate Bell
Bell -> Bell: router.push('/notifications')
Bell --> User: 導航至通知中心
deactivate Bell

User -> Center: 訪問 /notifications
activate Center

== Stage 10d: 載入完整通知列表 ==
Center -> Composable: fetchNotifications()
activate Composable
Composable -> API: GET /notifications?page=1&per_page=50
activate API
API -> Blueprint: GET /notifications?page=1&per_page=50
activate Blueprint
Blueprint -> Blueprint: @jwt_required() 驗證
Blueprint -> Service: list_notifications(user_id, read_filter=None, page=1, per_page=50)
activate Service
Service -> NotificationModel: 查詢完整通知列表
activate NotificationModel
NotificationModel -> DB: SELECT * FROM notifications\nWHERE recipient_id=?\nORDER BY created_at DESC\nLIMIT 50 OFFSET 0
activate DB
DB --> NotificationModel: notifications records
deactivate DB
NotificationModel --> Service: notifications[]
deactivate NotificationModel
Service --> Blueprint: {notifications[], total, pages}
deactivate Service
Blueprint --> API: 200 OK
deactivate Blueprint
API --> Composable: notifications[]
deactivate API
Composable --> Center: notifications[]
deactivate Composable

== Stage 11d: 渲染完整通知列表 ==
Center -> Center: 渲染完整通知列表\n- 分頁控制\n- 篩選按鈕 (全部/未讀/已讀)\n- 標記已讀按鈕\n- 刪除按鈕\n- 通知詳細內容
Center --> User: 顯示完整通知中心
deactivate Center

note over Center
通知中心功能:
1. 分頁瀏覽 (每頁 50 則)
2. 篩選 (全部/未讀/已讀)
3. 單一標記已讀
4. 單一刪除
5. 點擊通知查看詳情並標記已讀
6. 顯示通知類型圖示
7. 顯示相對時間
end note

end

== Stage 12: 錯誤處理 ==
note over Bell, Service
可能的錯誤情況:
1. 401 Unauthorized: JWT token 無效或過期
   → 重導向到登入頁
   
2. 404 Not Found: 通知不存在
   → 顯示「通知不存在」並重新載入列表
   
3. 403 Forbidden: 嘗試操作他人的通知
   → 顯示「無權限操作此通知」
   
4. 500 Internal Server Error: 資料庫錯誤
   → 顯示「操作失敗，請稍後再試」

錯誤處理流程:
- API Client 攔截錯誤
- Composable 設定 error.value
- Component 顯示錯誤訊息
- 重新載入通知列表
end note

== Stage 13: 輪詢機制 ==
note over Bell, Composable
輪詢機制運作:
1. 頁面載入時啟動 startPolling()
2. 立即執行一次 fetchUnreadCount()
3. 每 30 秒自動執行 fetchUnreadCount()
4. 頁面卸載時停止 stopPolling()
5. 更新 unreadCount 並刷新徽章

生命週期:
- onMounted: startPolling()
- onUnmounted: stopPolling()
- 使用 setInterval 實現定時輪詢
end note

== Stage 14: 通知類型與格式化 ==
note over Composable, Service
Notification Model 欄位:
- notification_id: 通知 ID (BIGINT)
- recipient_id: 接收者 user_id
- actor_id: 執行動作者 user_id (可為 NULL)
- type: 通知類型字串
- payload: JSON 格式額外資料
- read: 已讀狀態 (Boolean)
- created_at: 建立時間
- read_at: 已讀時間 (可為 NULL)

通知類型 (type):
- application_submitted: 申請已提交
- application_approved: 申請已核准
- application_rejected: 申請已拒絕
- application_under_review: 申請審核中
- animal_published: 動物已發布
- animal_retired: 動物已下架
- animal_status_changed: 動物狀態變更
- job_completed: 背景任務完成
- system_notification: 系統通知

格式化規則:
- 時間: formatDistanceToNow (相對時間)
- 未讀數量: > 99 顯示 "99+"
- 顏色: 未讀藍色背景 (bg-blue-50)
end note

== Stage 15: Click Outside 關閉機制 ==
note over Bell
v-click-outside directive:
1. 監聽 document 的 click 事件
2. 判斷點擊是否在下拉選單外部
3. 若在外部則執行 closeDropdown()
4. 使用 setTimeout 延遲註冊避免衝突
5. onUnmounted 時移除事件監聽器

實現邏輯:
- mounted: 註冊 click 事件 (延遲 0ms)
- unmounted: 移除 click 事件
- 確保不與 toggleDropdown 衝突
end note

@enduml